    "4.5",
    "Properties file used by AutoCAD, a CAD productivity application; contains settings for publishing a drawing to a.DWF file or to another plotter format; used for saving reusable publishing settings for different types of output. DSD files save the dialog box selections for the publishing process used by the PUBLISH command. When reading a DSD file, the publishing process automatically populates the dialog box with the pre-saved selections so that no user interaction is required. Windows Autodesk AutoCAD 2023. Data file created by Diet Studio, a diet research and development program; contains diet plan information and related data; saved in an XML format, which allows the data to be easily converted to different formats. Windows Numerical Computing Diet StudioFree. 3D image settings file created by DAZ Studio, a 3D modeling application; saves morph (shape/position alteration) data for objects in a 3D scene; referenced by a.DAZ scene file and is used with.DSO and.DSV files to comprise the scene. Mac DAZ 3D DAZ Studio 4. Windows DAZ 3D DAZ Studio 4Free.",
