    "Desktop theme file used by Stardock MyColors, a Windows desktop theme manager; contains colors, display style settings, icons, and graphics; used for changing the look and feel of the desktop environment. Stardock MyColors is available for Windows XP, Vista, and 7. Windows Stardock MyColors.",
